            2,
            3,
            4
          ],
          "description": "1..4. ADVISORY AND NON-AUTHORITATIVE: hierarchy position belongs to the display set, not the display (docs/11 11.4) — the same L3 may sit under two L2 areas for two operator roles. Used only by validation density rules."
